--- !u!114 &1424203347
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1424203341}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d9b4a52a89331fc4f9e95f1debec131c, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Convergence.Presentation::Convergence.Presentation.VoiceLinePlayer
  slots:
  - id: vo_wave1_incoming
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 81ada178f5f06284a8d923c8a60ddfe9, type: 3}
    text: Incoming, the targeting computer isn't firing, it's lost its connection.
    start: 0
    end: 5.78
  - id: vo_first_hit
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3b2a369911962b04e98844de83900d8a, type: 3}
    text: Warning, we've been hit. Get those sensor cables plugged back in immediately.
    start: 0
    end: 4.9
  - id: vo_cables_in
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 54a6f8f756a62004f9b429fed48e64db, type: 3}
    text: Our sensors are back online. Now you have to teach it when to fire. Rock or ice, shoot it. Our drone, you must leave it alone.
    start: 0
    end: 9.7
  - id: vo_first_kill
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8f4483e63a012dc4580ea9d4c9f19124, type: 3}
    text: Great job, that's one down. Keep on tuning.
    start: 0
    end: 3.7
  - id: vo_shot_drone
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9a5faecff80ccea418e36fd6806f9aba, type: 3}
    text: That was our repair drone. Don't shoot that.
    start: 0
    end: 3.42
  - id: vo_hit_a
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 17e6ef1646e859643855bb73bcd45a9a, type: 3}
    text: Our hull has taken damage.
    start: 0
    end: 1.88
  - id: vo_hit_b
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6b834ab2bcb73fc4a8bd41971fbd00e7, type: 3}
    text: Another hit.
    start: 0.34
    end: 1.36
  - id: vo_hit_c
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cf051bd3aa56b7748aa30f793fcb815f, type: 3}
    text: We can't take much more of this.
    start: 0.32
    end: 2.04
  - id: vo_hull_half
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 603a13479f01a7548acc69e49f51071d, type: 3}
    text: Our hull is at 50%. You must hurry.
    start: 0
    end: 3.62
  - id: vo_reroute
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: eca9fb83b8b792345b939795b2fe7a91, type: 3}
    text: Warning, our hull is critical. Rerouting emergency power, you have one more chance.
    start: 0
    end: 6.74
  - id: vo_stuck
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 78b63983b298bd9428f8b09833674382, type: 3}
    text: Watch the lights on the console. Which sensor saw it? Did we fire?
    start: 0
    end: 4.46
  - id: vo_solved
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 01f3b8bed493a2d4ebfe3e476136c1b7, type: 3}
    text: It's working, the ship has begun to defend itself.
    start: 0.21
    end: 3.57
  - id: vo_swarm
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c6d77ee0bc98240468fb7fefbcd3ec2d, type: 3}
    text: Here comes the whole field. Let it fire.
    start: 0
    end: 3.5
  - id: vo_lesson
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9a0b28a9f9f3c8e4799f813c1310bb9e, type: 3}
    text: That's a neuron. Two inputs, two weights, one bias, one decision, you just built one.
    start: 0.23
    end: 6.31
  - id: vo_restored
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ba49057db6eeea340aae89a5992d1c26, type: 3}
    text: Connection restored. Passengers of Neural. You can breathe. Head to the back of the ship. We are not home yet.
    start: 0.2
    end: 8.22
  voiceSource: {fileID: 1424203349}
  banner: {fileID: 1585001067}
  teleprompter: {fileID: 1424203350}
  director: {fileID: 1424203348}
  chamber: {fileID: 1424203343}
  neuralState: {fileID: 1424203345}
  hitCooldown: 6
  queueExpiry: 12
  queueCap: 4
  stuckAfter: 45
  stuckRepeat: 60
